## Not covered by any of the above

**Trademarks.** The copperhead word mark and the snake lockup rendered into the silkscreen of
`hardware/` and `fab/` are trademarks. No trademark rights are granted by any licence above.
Remove them from derivative boards.

**Third-party libraries.** `hardware/libs/` and `hardware/sym-lib-cache/` contain footprints
and symbols derived from the KiCad standard libraries, which carry their own licence (CC-BY-SA
4.0 with an exception for use in designs; see https://www.kicad.org/libraries/license/). That
exception is why boards using them, including this one, are not forced to CC-BY-SA.

**Component 3D models.** The models inside the files in `3d/` come from the KiCad standard
library and are generic package bodies, not the exact manufacturer parts.
